# =============================================================================
# .gitignore
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This project has no dependencies, no build step and no generated output, so
# there is very little to exclude. Everything here is either an operating
# system artefact or an editor's private state — nothing that belongs to the
# site itself.
#
# Note in particular what is NOT ignored: assets/img is committed. It is around
# 11 MB of ordinary photographs, which git handles comfortably, and the site
# does not work without them.
# =============================================================================

# --- Windows ---
Thumbs.db
Thumbs.db:encryptable
ehthumbs.db
ehthumbs_vista.db
desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# --- OneDrive ---
# The project folder lives inside OneDrive, which leaves sync state behind.
*.tmp
~$*

# --- macOS, in case the project is ever opened there ---
.DS_Store
._*

# --- Editors ---
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# --- Logs ---
# The local dev server can be started with its output redirected to a file.
*.log
dev/*.log
